# Closed-Loop Local AI Blender Critic & Skill Bridge (`blender-local-ai-critic-loop`)

Raw local 7B–8B models normally trail cloud frontier models (Gemini 4 Argon) on Blender 3D tasks because they hallucinate deprecated Blender 2.8/3.x APIs, stack un-remeshed "balloon-animal" primitives, and cannot visually inspect their own renders.

This skill elevates local RTX 5060 models to **Gemini + Skill parity** through three architectural mechanisms:
1. **Skill-Fused Local Model (`blender-architect:latest`):** Built via `ollama create blender-architect -f config/Modelfile.blender-architect` on top of `qwen2.5-coder:7b` with Blender 5.2 API laws, SDF Voxel Remesh + Laplacian Smooth organic rules, RTX 5060 OptiX baking, and X-Ray/OGSR `.ogf` v4 `uint16` constraints baked directly into the system weights.
2. **Dynamic `SKILL.md` Rule Injection (`local-coprocessor --skill` / `--auto-skill`):** Automatically loads the exact markdown specifications from `blender-sdf-organic-remeshing`, `character-creature-anatomy-modeling`, `blender-3d-engineering`, and `xray-ogf-dm-blender-pipeline` into any local model's context window.
3. **Closed-Loop Headless Audit + VLM Render Critique (`bin/blender-local-ai`):** Runs headless Blender 5.2 (`bmesh` manifold/proportion/bone audit) + local **`minicpm-v:8b`** / **`moondream`** visual render inspection before generating surgical `bpy` diffs.

